%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('beggar_informant')
goto: Informant

cond: HasFlag('beggar_helped')
goto: Thankful

cond: true
goto: Begging

%rec: Nodes
%type: npc multiline

name: Begging
npc: (A hunched man in a soaked blanket rattles a cup with a few coins in it.)
+ Spare some sat, choomba? Anything helps.
#
o_text: Here, take 10 sat.
o_id: give_1
o_cond: HasItem('gold', 10) && !HasFlag('beggar_gift_1')
o_goto: Gift1
#
o_text: Here, take 50 sat. Get yourself something warm.
o_id: give_big
o_cond: HasItem('gold', 50)
o_goto: GiveBig
#
o_text: Sorry, not today.
o_goto: Goodbye

name: Thankful
npc: Hey, it's you again. Still alive out here, thanks to you.
#
o_text: Here, another 10.
o_id: give_2
o_cond: HasItem('gold', 10) && HasFlag('beggar_gift_1') && !HasFlag('beggar_gift_2')
o_goto: Gift2
#
o_text: Here, a third 10. Don't spend it all at once.
o_id: give_3
o_cond: HasItem('gold', 10) && HasFlag('beggar_gift_2') && !HasFlag('beggar_gift_3')
o_goto: Gift3
#
o_text: Here, take 10 sat.
o_id: give_1_late
o_cond: HasItem('gold', 10) && !HasFlag('beggar_gift_1')
o_goto: Gift1
#
o_text: Take care.
o_goto: Goodbye

name: Gift1
npc: (He nods and pockets the coins.) Thanks. You're alright.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 10)
effect: SetFlag('beggar_gift_1')
effect: SetFlag('beggar_helped')
effect: EndConversation

name: Gift2
npc: Twice now. (He squints at you.) Most people don't look at me once.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 10)
effect: SetFlag('beggar_gift_2')
effect: EndConversation

name: Gift3
npc: (He closes his hand around the coins and leans in.)
+ Three times. Fine. I sit here all day and nobody sees me, which means I see everything.
+ You ever need to know something about this town, ask. On the house.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 10)
effect: SetFlag('beggar_gift_3')
effect: SetFlag('beggar_informant')
effect: EndConversation

name: GiveBig
npc: (He stares at the money, then at you.) That's... more than I see in a week.
+ Bless you, choomba. I won't forget this.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 50)
effect: SetFlag('beggar_helped')
effect: EndConversation

name: Informant
npc: (He does not rattle the cup for you anymore.) Ears open, choomba. What do you need?
#
o_text: A mansion outside the wall. Rich man hiding in it. Where?
o_id: rumour_mansion
o_cond: !HasFlag('LocationKnown(mansion)')
o_goto: RumourMansion
#
o_text: Anybody lost a duck?
o_id: rumour_duck
o_goto: RumourDuck
#
o_text: Who is Richard Shaw?
o_id: rumour_shaw
o_goto: RumourShaw
#
o_text: Nothing today. Stay warm.
o_id: informant_leave
o_goto: Goodbye

name: RumourMansion
npc: The catering vans. Terra Vitae's people load them at the west rim every month and the taxi takes them
+ through the south gate, out the old highway, half an hour. Big place with its own wall. Faust, the driver called him.
effect: SetFlag('LocationKnown(mansion)')
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

name: RumourDuck
npc: Anna Whitaker's synth duck. Southside. Waddled into the storm drain by the hospital, the rats have it now.
+ Big Bob would pay for the parts. Anna would pay to get it back. Your call what kind of person you are.
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

name: RumourShaw
npc: Collector in the commerce zone. Buys anything the cleansing left behind: tags, papers, teeth.
+ Pays well, asks nothing. Which tells you plenty.
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

name: Goodbye
npc: (He goes back to rattling his cup.)
effect: EndConversation
